# Every file here is content-hashed by MANIFEST.txt and checked by the test
# suite, so git must not rewrite line endings: a checkout that turned LF into
# CRLF would change the bytes and make the manifest disagree with the tree.
# `-text` disables the conversion for everything; diffs still work normally.
* -text

# The shipped binaries are binary in every sense.
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
